{"id":"teatro","lemma":"teatro","pos":"noun","rank":1469,"glosses":["theater (a place or building, consisting of a stage and seating, in which an audience gathers to watch plays, musical performances, public ceremonies, and so on)","drama (theatrical plays in general)"],"ipa":"/teˈa.tro/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"teatri"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-teatro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Che teatro è quello?","en":"Which theater is that?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Ti piacerebbe andare a teatro stasera?","en":"Would you like to go to the theater this evening?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"pleasure, enjoyment","l":"piacere"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"to / at"},null,{"g":"this evening, tonight"}]},{"text":"Ero al teatro.","en":"I was at the theater.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Il teatro è vuoto.","en":"The theater is empty.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"gap"}]},{"text":"Poi siamo andati al teatro.","en":"Then we went to the theater.","words":[{"g":"then"},{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"to the"},null]}]}